@startuml
title Generate Report

actor Admin
participant DashboardFrame
participant SystemController
participant ReportService
database HospitalRepository

Admin -> DashboardFrame: click Generate Report
DashboardFrame -> SystemController: generateReport()
SystemController -> ReportService: generateReport()
ReportService -> HospitalRepository: getPatients()
HospitalRepository --> ReportService: patients
ReportService -> HospitalRepository: getAppointments()
HospitalRepository --> ReportService: appointments
ReportService -> ReportService: count totals and build schedules
ReportService --> SystemController: ReportSummary
SystemController --> DashboardFrame: ReportSummary
DashboardFrame -> Admin: display totals and doctor schedules
@enduml
